  "details": "Right now the on screen joystick activates down in the corner on mobile. It's like half the screen up in landscape and 1/4th in portrait mode.\n\nI would like to see that joystick to be on a bigger part of the screen. Keep how wide the joystick area is, but make it reach further up. The whole screen up in landscape and half the screen in portrait.\n\nWhy? It's really uncomfortable (for me at least) when you have bigger hands. So being able to have your thumbs in more of a rest position would really help.",
